DeskPal
Application originally developed by Zhe Chen for the EEEE3124 Internet of Things
(2024/25) Mini Project at the University of Nottingham Ningbo China.
Public project packaging prepared in 2026.

The application uses an Edge Impulse inference example pattern and generated
PoseDetection library. Edge Impulse, TensorFlow Lite, ARM CMSIS, Kiss FFT,
FlatBuffers, gemmlowp and other upstream components retain their original
copyright notices and licenses. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the library files.

